+        // sentinels and sSoh3DSkybox is exactly that bracket -- the 3D-panel
+        // path below has used it since R0 to make the skybox skew-only, i.e.
+        // zero disparity, i.e. infinity. This VR branch never consulted it:
+        // it substituted the composed A.V.P for EVERY perspective draw and
+        // the sentinel fell straight through.
